Mantella NPCs who live through OStim scenes with you: scenes that flow on their own, and partners who react, talk and remember.

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]FEATURES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Feature[/th][th]What it does[/th][/tr][tr][td]Scene flows[/td][td]Builds each scene live from your own animation packs[/td][/tr][tr][td]Finish scenes[/td][td]Played when the man is close; borrowed from another pack if needed[/td][/tr][tr][td]Not satisfied?[/td][td]A new round starts in the same pack after her climax[/td][/tr][tr][td]Your control[/td][td]Pick a scene yourself and the flow steps back[/td][/tr][tr][td]Favourite positions[/td][td]Rated from her personality, learned from your scenes[/td][/tr][tr][td]Position requests[/td][td]Ask her in conversation; she switches if it fits[/td][/tr][tr][td]Group scenes[/td][td]Scene talk names everyone; flows stay two-person[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]WHAT MANTELLA HEARS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Moment[/th][th]Example line[/th][/tr][tr][td]Scene starts or moves on[/td][td]Vega and the player have started: a blowjob.[/td][/tr][tr][td]Excitement 30 / 50 / 75[/td][td]Vega is really into it now; she reacts out loud.[/td][/tr][tr][td]Pace change[/td][td]The pace picks up; it is now steady.[/td][/tr][tr][td]Climax[/td][td]Vega just climaxed.  (+ a remark from someone watching)[/td][/tr][tr][td]Scene ends[/td][td]One summary: where, how long, what you did, climaxes.[/td][/tr][/table]
[spoiler][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1704/images/196850/196850-1793033586-163909772.png[/img][/spoiler]
[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98163]OStim Standalone[/url] and at least one animation pack[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196851]Mantella Living World - Arousal[/url] (recommended)[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install the hub, then this module.[/*][*]Close the game and run Build Flows (in the mod's tools folder; needs Python and Mod Organizer 2).[/*][*]Enable the generated Flows mod.[/*][*]Run Build Flows again whenever you add or remove animation packs.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Settings: OStim's MCM, page "Living World".[/*][*]Flows stay two-person; group scenes still get scene talk.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-OStim-Expansion]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

